WEBVTT

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.260
Lost in the direction of a vast road ahead

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:27.300
Want to escape the cycle, be myself for once

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:30.400
Crashing into a chaotic world

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.690
Ever since I met you, my course has changed

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:40.940
Define the world as infinity

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:43.460
No need to be suspicious

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:45.160
No need to doubt

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:49.500
You're light, I'm darkness, in mutual opposition

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.780
Like the opposite ends of magnets

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:53.740
In natural tacit agreement

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:57.480
Quarrel gets reconciled in split seconds

00:00:57.480 --> 00:01:02.420
Can't see and can't hear in subtlety

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:07.720
You know what I'm thinking

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:11.980
Your trust is burning

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:17.060
is my smiling response to the world

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:19.360
Relying on each other

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:21.960
Vast potential to rewrite life

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:23.860
May be unexpected

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:25.820
In every circumstance

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:33.500
To face all battles together

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.400
Let the chains that bound us together

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:40.340
Converge into an unlimited, exciting

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:45.520
Splendor

00:01:45.970 --> 00:01:49.440
Soul Contract

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:54.200
Fourth Contract

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:58.690
Subbed by EP of Bayi Subs

00:02:06.779 --> 00:02:07.949
Who are you?

00:02:07.949 --> 00:02:09.750
Why do you keep following me?

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:11.525
Well

00:02:11.525 --> 00:02:12.543
No, I didn't

00:02:12.969 --> 00:02:14.400
Maybe it's just coincidence

00:02:15.512 --> 00:02:16.148
Oh yeah

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:16.820
My name's...

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:17.560
Young master

00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:19.310
Why didn't you wear your coat?

00:02:19.319 --> 00:02:21.041
If you catch a cold

00:02:21.041 --> 00:02:23.570
Us servants would be in trouble

00:02:23.843 --> 00:02:25.586
No matter when

00:02:25.586 --> 00:02:27.201
No matter where

00:02:27.201 --> 00:02:29.011
What he leaves me

00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:31.880
is his receding figure that is forever out of reach

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:33.250
Since the beginning,

00:02:33.258 --> 00:02:36.010
our fate are predestined to be like this

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:38.805
He is protected by everyone

00:02:38.805 --> 00:02:40.601
while I'm always just

00:02:40.601 --> 00:02:44.870
a bystander with no identity

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:48.460
She's here

00:02:48.462 --> 00:02:49.759
She's the chosen lady

00:02:59.058 --> 00:03:00.369
Master Xi

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:02.120
I'm Qin Siyao

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:05.500
- From now on, I'm your fiancée
- Master Xi is the youngest Yangming Master ever

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:06.920
To be his future fiancée

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:08.800
is such a great blessing

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:09.640
I heard

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:12.460
her fiery Yang physique can help extend his life

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:15.400
That's how she got accepted by Duanmu's family

00:03:21.229 --> 00:03:22.233
Why

00:03:22.466 --> 00:03:25.977
do you always turn your back,

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:28.400
Duanmu Xi?

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:29.830
Duanmu Xi!

00:03:29.839 --> 00:03:30.671
Hey!

00:03:30.671 --> 00:03:31.481
Duanmu Xi!

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:31.980
Hey,

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:32.770
Qin Siyao

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:34.040
Why you stare into space?

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:35.280
What's going on?

00:03:37.386 --> 00:03:38.824
This is the Dead Soul's Field

00:03:38.824 --> 00:03:41.733
We're trapped in the space created by a band of spirits

00:03:41.733 --> 00:03:42.670
What?

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:43.796
What about Duanmu Xi?

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:45.420
Isn't he at the door outside?

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:46.640
Come and save us,

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:48.470
Duanmu Xi!

00:03:51.677 --> 00:03:53.386
Should be near...

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:56.190
Duanmu Xi you white-haired pig

00:03:56.198 --> 00:03:58.745
I'm fool to believe your promise and end up this way

00:03:58.745 --> 00:04:00.146
What sucky Yangming Master

00:04:00.146 --> 00:04:01.301
What contract signing

00:04:01.301 --> 00:04:03.463
I effing got my brain crushed by the truck

00:04:03.463 --> 00:04:04.177
Hey

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:06.140
Can't you exorcise these evil spirits

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:07.460
and break the field?

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:07.980
Break?

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:09.200
You think I'm Inspector Kogoro Mouri

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:10.190
who solves cases easily?

00:04:10.199 --> 00:04:12.466
I sometimes practice drawing yellow paper talisman
(Note: Commonly used for blessing the home)

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:13.420
Yellow paper talisman, got it?
(Note: Commonly used for blessing the home)

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:14.280
How ya wanna get it work?
(Note: Commonly used for blessing the home)

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:16.100
Does throwing a whole stack works?

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:18.450
Can't believe you're a quack

00:04:18.450 --> 00:04:20.514
What does Duanmu Xi see in you anyway?

00:04:20.514 --> 00:04:21.718
I was cheated by him

00:04:21.718 --> 00:04:23.050
As a Soul Image, so what?

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:25.075
He never gives me any decent weapon

00:04:25.075 --> 00:04:26.577
except these crappy rings

00:04:29.900 --> 00:04:30.980
Idiot, duck quickly!

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:33.580
You're doomed if you get seized by these spirits

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:39.793
Kill him

00:04:39.793 --> 00:04:42.201
Kill this Soul Image

00:04:42.201 --> 00:04:42.933
No

00:04:42.933 --> 00:04:44.015
I can't

00:04:44.015 --> 00:04:45.496
Duanmu will get mad

00:04:45.496 --> 00:04:48.674
Look how close they are

00:04:48.670 --> 00:04:53.180
Has Duanmu ever spoken a word to you after so many years?

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:54.240
Don't say it

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:57.060
I'm Duanmu's fiancée

00:04:57.067 --> 00:05:00.417
But who's more important in Duanmu's heart?

00:05:00.417 --> 00:05:01.380
Yang Jinghua!

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:01.397
Can't you see it?
Yang Jinghua!

00:05:01.397 --> 00:05:03.860
Can't you see it?

00:05:03.867 --> 00:05:04.597
No

00:05:04.597 --> 00:05:05.887
That's not it!

00:05:05.887 --> 00:05:08.097
I've worked so hard for so many years

00:05:08.097 --> 00:05:11.467
Learned to become the perfect lady for Duanmu

00:05:11.467 --> 00:05:13.027
Talents and manners

00:05:13.027 --> 00:05:15.447
Every steps taken were meant for him

00:05:15.447 --> 00:05:17.947
He wouldn't just ignore me

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:22.080
Has he ever seen any of your hard works?

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:24.320
Duanmu never accepts a Soul Image

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:26.670
Why then would he choose Yang Jinghua?

00:05:26.677 --> 00:05:30.097
Because he is more important than you

00:05:32.557 --> 00:05:33.907
Shoo!

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:34.860
Be gone, evil spirts!

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:37.180
Divine Spirit Seven Kill Order! (Refer Chinese Mystery Man)

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:39.050
These evil spirits seems to be

00:05:39.057 --> 00:05:40.477
scared of this crappy ring

00:05:40.477 --> 00:05:42.307
So they kinda works

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:43.580
I say, Qin Siyao

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:45.320
You know how to use these rings?

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:47.180
Maybe we can use them to break free

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:48.670
He's mine

00:05:48.677 --> 00:05:51.777
Why do you steal him from me?

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:53.580
Hey

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.500
You're possessed...?

00:05:58.887 --> 00:06:00.557
Stop

00:06:01.084 --> 00:06:03.555
Give him back

00:06:03.555 --> 00:06:05.996
Give him back to me

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:08.160
Sorry

00:06:08.163 --> 00:06:09.152
Yang Jinghua

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:12.140
As long as you stay as his Soul Image

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:15.080
I will always be in the shadow

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:18.320
living in a world where he always turns his back

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:19.270
Why?

00:06:19.274 --> 00:06:20.913
I'm already dead

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:24.560
but I still feel like I get painfully choked

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:27.600
As if I'm drowning in water

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:30.470
My body is sinking deeper

00:06:30.752 --> 00:06:33.439
Am I going to vanish forever?

00:06:35.703 --> 00:06:37.025
Where am I?

00:06:37.276 --> 00:06:39.156
Is this a dream?

00:06:39.741 --> 00:06:41.519
Qin Siyao

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:57.260
That ginger haired girl

00:06:57.260 --> 00:06:59.340
How can she be suited for a Yangming Master?

00:06:59.340 --> 00:07:01.280
If it weren't for the Qin family's relationship

00:07:01.289 --> 00:07:03.086
Would that gal even get the chance?

00:07:03.086 --> 00:07:05.880
I feel for the Master's disgrace

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:12.300
So it turns out

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:14.550
you've been suffering

00:07:19.627 --> 00:07:21.017
I'm too late

00:07:21.010 --> 00:07:23.160
She's completely possessed

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:24.530
Duanmu Xi you bastard

00:07:24.530 --> 00:07:27.080
Don't you realize how much you've hurt Qin Siyao?

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:28.540
I'm going to save her

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:30.181
Get a grip of yourself

00:07:30.181 --> 00:07:32.975
Since you're protected by the rings and my power,

00:07:32.975 --> 00:07:35.824
the evil spirits are unable to harm you

00:07:35.824 --> 00:07:36.420
So

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:39.532
they need someone else to do it

00:07:39.532 --> 00:07:40.357
Just now

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:43.180
you almost got taken by them into the depth of darkness

00:07:43.180 --> 00:07:44.820
Qin Siyao is already

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:46.570
being controlled by them

00:07:46.578 --> 00:07:49.733
Moreover, she has malicious aura that comes from her heart

00:07:49.967 --> 00:07:51.910
Yang Jinghua

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:53.999
I want you dead!

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:03.390
Kill the Soul Image

00:08:03.394 --> 00:08:05.534
Take his power

00:08:05.770 --> 00:08:08.680
Seriously, nothing good comes along ever since I met you

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:10.310
Are you not a Yangming Master?

00:08:10.310 --> 00:08:11.720
Can't you do something?

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:12.820
If I can do it,

00:08:12.827 --> 00:08:14.842
would I still need a Soul Image?

00:08:14.842 --> 00:08:18.866
Yangming Master are forbidden use power against the living

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:20.350
The hell

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:21.820
This is my first day at work

00:08:21.820 --> 00:08:23.380
I still haven't figured out

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:25.040
What weapons are you good at?

00:08:26.014 --> 00:08:28.048
I used to play sword fighting game

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:29.500
This might suit you

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:31.540
Saint Sword, Hime Sword, Luxury Sword, Tiger Teeth Sword

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:32.300
All are fine

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:32.760
Quick

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:33.760
Give me your hand

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:34.520
What?

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:35.580
Wanna hug?

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:37.060
Just your right hand

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:42.440
Qin Siyao is

00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:43.920
becoming weirder?

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:46.380
She's going to be swallowed completely by them

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:48.510
Her last conscience will soon be gone

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.700
She's going berserk

00:08:50.703 --> 00:08:51.869
Hurry up

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:53.500
Visualize the sword's form

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:56.260
I can't even concentrate right now at this moment

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.040
Use your own ability

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:01.420
Your binding rings will

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:03.690
forge the most suitable weapon for you

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:05.830
The rings

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:14.720
This is?

00:09:19.521 --> 00:09:22.756
A long sword really appears out of thin air

00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:25.600
You are truly that guy

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:27.870
A great blade in my hands

00:09:27.872 --> 00:09:29.366
Time to send you off

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:30.410
Be careful

00:09:30.411 --> 00:09:32.475
The room right now is cluttered by

00:09:32.470 --> 00:09:34.840
2 kinds of chi energy, one is hers

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:35.910
One wrong move

00:09:35.911 --> 00:09:37.790
She'll fall much faster

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:42.948
For a veteran gamer like me who played shooting games at the arcade since young

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:45.520
I can easily score a rank at this difficulty

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:46.180
Top

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:46.990
Bottom

00:09:46.993 --> 00:09:49.072
- Go left a bit, left a bit
- It's so messy how am I supposed to slice?

00:09:49.072 --> 00:09:50.071
- Right, right
- It moves

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:52.080
- No, the one at the back
- So embarrassing

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:55.070
I say, can a veteran be more serious

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:57.913
You just stood there ordering

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:00.600
(Why don't you do it yourself? No bossing around!)

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:16.710
So fast

00:10:16.718 --> 00:10:19.733
He snatches all of them

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:23.540
Now!

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:24.440
Why

00:10:24.444 --> 00:10:25.920
am I trembling?

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:29.060
His overwhelming power right in front of me

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:30.630
Even as a Soul Image

00:10:30.634 --> 00:10:32.276
I feel the jitters

00:10:32.276 --> 00:10:34.789
and the great desire to shudder

00:10:35.131 --> 00:10:36.324
Damn it

00:10:36.324 --> 00:10:38.554
Stop mocking me!

00:10:47.741 --> 00:10:48.772
Are you alright?

00:10:48.772 --> 00:10:49.788
Qin Siyao

00:10:50.835 --> 00:10:53.963
Why are you so easily manipulated by the evil spirits?

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:56.180
If you have too much malice in your heart,

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:58.580
you don't deserve to be part of Duanmu's family

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:03.100
That's because I peeked at her when she's showering

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:05.620
I've got awesome ability to penetrate walls

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:07.980
Why can't I have a peek at the goddess?

00:11:07.985 --> 00:11:08.746
Therefore,

00:11:08.746 --> 00:11:10.842
the evil spirits must've used her anger

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:14.180
Guess it's my first time getting aggressively attacked by a girl

00:11:14.180 --> 00:11:15.190
I have no regrets

00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:17.740
You son of a b*tch

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:18.780
Aren't you ashamed?

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:20.800
Now you know

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:22.060
Then just fire me

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:23.680
Don't take me as your Soul Image

00:11:24.045 --> 00:11:25.627
Not going to argue with you

00:11:25.627 --> 00:11:26.760
Let's go

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:27.902
Qin Siyao

00:11:27.902 --> 00:11:30.120
I understand how you feel

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:31.857
Even if you lose your dignity

00:11:31.857 --> 00:11:34.247
you still want so hard to protect the love

00:11:34.513 --> 00:11:35.688
The moment

00:11:35.688 --> 00:11:37.640
when I felt suffocated

00:11:37.640 --> 00:11:39.026
that's actually

00:11:39.026 --> 00:11:42.417
how you feel deep down inside, wasn't it?

00:11:42.417 --> 00:11:43.298
Yang Jinghua

00:11:43.298 --> 00:11:44.463
You won't go?

00:11:44.463 --> 00:11:46.939
You plan to stay overnight with your goddess?

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:47.460
Oh

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:48.160
Coming

00:11:50.089 --> 00:11:51.072
Qin Siyao,

00:11:51.072 --> 00:11:53.201
you come along too

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:55.720
It's still not safe out here

00:11:56.030 --> 00:11:58.650
You want me to go to your house?

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:00.447
Do you have to ask?

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:01.760
Go prepare yourself now

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:02.760
We'll be downstairs...

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:04.200
Then I hope you don't mind me

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:05.360
go over to your place

00:12:05.360 --> 00:12:05.880
Goddamn

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:08.210
This changing speed is phenomenal

00:12:09.582 --> 00:12:10.542
Say

00:12:10.542 --> 00:12:11.317
Duanmu

00:12:11.317 --> 00:12:12.768
I've got a question

00:12:12.760 --> 00:12:14.240
With that power of yours

00:12:14.240 --> 00:12:17.620
What took you so long to find us when we're trapped in that field?

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:19.540
They were much higher level

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:20.830
And they hide well

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:23.940
Did the next door get robbed?

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:24.440
Strange

00:12:24.447 --> 00:12:27.583
Who the heck broke down the door?

00:12:27.583 --> 00:12:29.271
Is he insane?

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:38.280
Lord Yinzhe

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:40.250
He has brought a Soul Image back

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:46.950
Yangming Master's Soul Image?

00:12:47.443 --> 00:12:50.430
I sure can't wait to meet him

00:12:50.820 --> 00:13:02.780
